  "comments": [
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " @target: es2015",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Each element expression in a non-empty array literal is processed as follows:",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "    - If the array literal contains no spread elements, and if the array literal is contextually typed (section 4.19)",
      "start": 102,
      "end": 221
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "      by a type T and T has a property with the numeric name N, where N is the index of the element expression in the array literal,",
      "start": 223,
      "end": 357
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "      the element expression is contextually typed by the type of that property.",
      "start": 359,
      "end": 441
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " The resulting type an array literal expression is determined as follows:",
      "start": 445,
      "end": 520
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "     - If the array literal contains no spread elements and is contextually typed by a tuple-like type,",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 627
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "       the resulting type is a tuple type constructed from the types of the element expressions.",
      "start": 629,
      "end": 727
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Error",
      "start": 789,
      "end": 797
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Error",
      "start": 857,
      "end": 865
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " The resulting type an array literal expression is determined as follows:",
      "start": 869,
      "end": 944
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "     - If the array literal contains no spread elements and is an array assignment pattern in a destructuring assignment (section 4.17.1),",
      "start": 946,
      "end": 1086
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "       the resulting type is a tuple type constructed from the types of the element expressions.",
      "start": 1088,
      "end": 1186
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " The resulting type an array literal expression is determined as follows:",
      "start": 1250,
      "end": 1325
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "      - the resulting type is an array type with an element type that is the union of the types of the",
      "start": 1327,
      "end": 1431
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "        non - spread element expressions and the numeric index signature types of the spread element expressions",
      "start": 1433,
      "end": 1547
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Error",
      "start": 1895,
      "end": 1903
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Error cannot assign number[] to [number, number, number]",
      "start": 1955,
      "end": 2014
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Error cannot assign (number|string)[] to number[]",
